-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
-- StackBuilder AI — Tools expansion 2026-10-20 (fleet-verified catalog growth)
-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
-- Adds every tool in fallback parts fb-8+ (the Oct 20 expansion) to the tools
-- table with its fleet-assigned category, for when the Supabase data layer is
-- wired. Every product was verified live on its official site on 2026-10-20.
--
-- PRICING HONESTY: pricing was deliberately NOT collected for these records.
-- The pricing_model enum has no 'unknown' value in 001_initial_schema.sql, so
-- this file first extends the enum with 'unknown' (mirroring the fallback
-- catalog's semantics) and inserts pricing_model='unknown'. has_free_plan is
-- NOT NULL in the schema; false is the conservative default (never overclaims
-- a free plan). All rows land freshness='unverified' for the freshness loop.
--
-- RE-RUNNABLE: tool/category inserts use ON CONFLICT ... DO NOTHING.
-- Run via: psql $DATABASE_URL -f data/tools-expansion-2026-10-20.sql
-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

ALTER TYPE pricing_model ADD VALUE IF NOT EXISTS 'unknown';

